4. **Q2 Budget Chart (Tom):** Tom inquires if Jordan received the Q2 Budget chart, noting that Jerry has made significant changes that may render earlier information outdated. He requests immediate feedback on the chart to avoid stalling the planning process and asks Jordan to send the Q2 profit forecast estimate to Catherine at contact@contact.com.

5. **Financial Audit Schedule for Q2 (Diana Wells, Chief Auditor):** A routine audit for Q2 is scheduled for the second week of next month, lasting approximately four days. All financial records, especially those related to recent budget revisions, must be accurate and available."
